title: "GenesisAeon v9.0: Living Crystal – A Metastable Threshold Field Simulation"
abstract: >-
  Release v9.0 packages the Living Crystal stack that resolves the
  Crystal-Death paradox: entropy anchors (StochasticResonator), active
  forcing (SolarDriver), and structural healing (TopologicalReaper) keep
  σ(β(R-Θ)) oscillating instead of freezing. The repository ships a single
  CLI entry point (`v9_alpha/main_simulation.py`) that runs Experiments C–E
  end-to-end, plus Sensorium streams that surface the climate–economy
  coupling signature. Artifacts include Zenodo metadata (.zenodo.json),
  Trilayer release notes (MD/JSON/YAML), and reproducible configs for
  Lantern-Hub/Bridge.
